      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we enable the punt feature only when transitioning from unattached to attached? Attaching A, replacing it with B, then removing B adds two feature entries but removes only one. Removal now clears the policer index to `~0`, so the remaining entry dereferences that invalid index on the next punt packet and crashes VPP. This reproduced under debug ASAN for both IPv4 and IPv6; `ip6_punt_policer_add_del()` needs the same adjustment. Please include traffic after replacement and removal in the regression coverage.",
      "tag": "prview:0b84948726333cc0d5d7d5133cff9660:dd1f5ce3d1d85aa7aa43541fe67004633493f6c6",
